-- תקנון שירות עובדי הוראה, פרק 4, §4.11 מורה בכיתה טיפולית
-- The section on the teacher in a therapeutic class: what is left of it is
-- the notice, under each of its two sub-headings, that it was cancelled.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT common

§ `4.11 מורה בכיתה טיפולית`

@desc The day the section on the teacher in a therapeutic class was cancelled (section 4.11.1 and 4.11.3 each say so).
`the day section 4.11 was cancelled` MEANS Date 1 9 1998

§§ `4.11.1 היקף משרתו של מורה בכיתה טיפולית`

@ref akn:chp_4__sec_4_11__ssec_4_11_1/p1
GIVEN d IS A DATE @desc the day a case arises
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the therapeutic-class position rules are in force on` d IF
    d LESS THAN `the day section 4.11 was cancelled`

-- akn:chp_4__sec_4_11__ssec_4_11_1/p2 Heading of the source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_4__sec_4_11__ssec_4_11_1/p3 Source (אסמכתא): a Director-General's circular of תשנ"ח.

§§ `4.11.3 הגדרת תפקידים`

@ref akn:chp_4__sec_4_11__ssec_4_11_3/p1
GIVEN d IS A DATE @desc the day a case arises
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the therapeutic-class role definitions are in force on` d IF
    d LESS THAN `the day section 4.11 was cancelled`

-- akn:chp_4__sec_4_11__ssec_4_11_3/p2 Heading of the source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_4__sec_4_11__ssec_4_11_3/p3 Source (אסמכתא): a Director-General's circular of תשנ"ח.

#ASSERT NOT `the therapeutic-class position rules are in force on` (Date 1 9 1998)
#ASSERT `the therapeutic-class role definitions are in force on` (Date 31 8 1998)
